    "Description": "A transparency slide showing the left side of a carousel pig that is very well worn. The pig is a light tan color, however much of the paint is missing, leaving black behind. The saddle is brown with a darker brown border. The saddle blanket is green with a red border and yellow detailing. The tack is red. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK 16B LEFT MID” at the top and “Pig RALEIGH NC WAKE CO 6/79 RR RALEIGH FINE ARTS SOCIETY” at the bottom.",
